{"kind": "mod", "id": 2540, "name": "Content Backport - Prestiges", "slug": "content-backport-prestiges", "teaser": "Already at prestige 4 and want to grind more? Then this mod is for you!", "owner_name": "ArchangelWTF", "downloads": 40983, "favourites": 143, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "wtf.archangel.contentbackportprestiges", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Overhauls", "category_id": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:55:33.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-01-07T11:51:10.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-01-07T10:59:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "1.0.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What’s included</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>‘Content Backport - Prestiges’ restores the missing prestiges from 1.0, this mod will allow you to prestige all the way to Prestige 6 (and receive the correct rewards for each prestige)</p>\n<p><strong>What this mod does, specifically:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Changes prestige 1 to 4 to have the new requirements added by BSG in 1.0.5.0</li>\n<li>Adds Prestige 5 and Prestige 6 to the game, as well as all the relevant images and client assets that are required for it (If they weren’t included in WTT’s Content Backport already)</li>\n<li>Adds the missing achievements for leveling up in prestige, you will now correctly receive the achievements for each prestige level (And also if your profile has prestiged past level 1 and never got any of the achievements!)</li>\n<li>Adds the missing requirements to the Collector quest, namely for the new streamer items</li>\n<li>Adds the missing ‘New Beginnings’ quests that are required on each prestige level.</li>\n<li>Removes the cheat code to be able to unlock the new prestige rewards (Sorry, you filthy cheaters :))</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What’s missing?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nothing, fully updated since July 2026 :)</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it has a different mod name. The installation is the same)\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"Handholding tutorial\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Groovey</strong> for being my support hotline and adding some missing things to WTT Backport that were required to make this mod</li>\n<li><strong>The WTT team</strong> for their amazing work on backporting the 1.0 content</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.3", "content_length": 22255700, "downloads": 1379, "published_at": "2026-01-07T12:31:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2540/content-backport-prestiges/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}, {"id": 2512, "name": "WTT - Content Backport", "slug": "wtt-content-backport"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.3", "content_length": 22262866, "downloads": 19460, "published_at": "2026-01-08T18:12:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2540/content-backport-prestiges/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}, {"id": 2512, "name": "WTT - Content Backport", "slug": "wtt-content-backport"}]}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.3", "content_length": 22269215, "downloads": 209, "publishe